{"id":"457899","name":"菜谱","author":"月亮私家烘焙","authorId":"10873203","desc":"","cover":"images/457899/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"西葫芦","amount":"1个"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"2勺"},{"name":"葱末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"枸杞","amount":"几颗"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"西葫芦洗净切丝，放入碗中，葱切末备用。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/11/20190511155753655434810873203.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":2,"desc":"锅内倒入适量油烧热，倒入切好的葱末爆出香味，放入切好的西葫芦丝翻炒至断生。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/11/20190511155753663617410873203.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅内倒入适量水烧开，磕入两个鸡蛋，用炒菜铲子搅散煮开。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/11/20190511155753670451110873203.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":4,"desc":"煮开的西葫芦鸡蛋汤加2勺盐搅拌几下即可。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/11/20190511155753680712210873203.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":5,"desc":"撒上几颗枸杞点缀一下，开吃。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/11/20190511155753717234510873203.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"}],"tips":"1:西葫芦具有美颜减肥，清热解毒，预防糖尿病，预防癌症等功效。\n\n2:嫌切丝麻烦的可以直接切片。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}